# mex AST index — generated, rebuilt by `mex graph index`.
# The -wal/-shm sidecars are live SQLite journal state and change on every
# read, so tracking them produces permanent spurious diffs.
.mex/graph.db
.mex/graph.db-shm
.mex/graph.db-wal
